Package: PhiSpace
Title: Continuous cell state annotation for single-cell and spatial omics data
Version: 1.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jiadong", "Mao", , "chiatungmao@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3818-1981"))
Description: Continuous phenotyping of bulk, single-cell and spatial omics data using partial least squares regression.
    The methods are described in Mao et al. (2025) <doi:10.1186/s13059-025-03755-8>
    and Mao et al. (2026) <doi:10.1016/j.crmeth.2026.101483>.
